                      "name": "generate_and_link_docx",
                      "arguments": "{\"filename\":\"Assignment_Group_Report_Template.docx\",\"content\":\"# Assignment Group Report Template\\n\\n## Cover Page  \\n- **Report Title:** [Insert Report Title Here]  \\n- **Group Number:** [Group Number]  \\n- **Submitted to:** [Instructor's Name]  \\n- **Submitted by:** [Names of Group Members]  \\n- **Date:** [Submission Date]  \\n\\n---\\n\\n## Table of Contents  \\n1. Executive Summary  \\n2. Introduction  \\n3. Methodology  \\n4. Findings & Analysis  \\n5. Discussion  \\n6. Recommendations  \\n7. Conclusion  \\n8. References  \\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Executive Summary  \\n[Summarize the key points of the report, findings, and conclusions.]  \\n\\n## 2. Introduction  \\n- Background of the project.  \\n- Objectives.  \\n- Scope of the report.  \\n\\n## 3. Methodology  \\n- Description of research methods or processes used.  \\n- Data collection techniques.  \\n\\n## 4. Findings & Analysis  \\n- Main findings of the report.  \\n- Supporting evidence.  \\n- Data visualization (e.g., charts/tables if applicable).  \\n\\n## 5. Discussion  \\n- Interpretation of findings.  \\n- Relevance to the research/problem statement.  \\n\\n## 6. Recommendations  \\n- Suggestions based on findings to address issues or improve outcomes.  \\n\\n## 7. Conclusion  \\n- Summary of key points.  \\n- Final remarks or takeaways.  \\n\\n## 8. References  \\n[List all sources referred to in the report in a proper referencing style, e.g., APA/MLA.]  \\n\\n---\\n\\n## Appendix (Optional)  \\n[Include supplementary material if necessary.]\"}",
